                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I discovered this fun dungeon crawler at PAX 2018, I believe. It has a good selection of heroes to choose from, along with multiple game modes, although I’ve only played one of them, so I can’t say much about the online multiplayer/coop.\n\nI’ve had a lot of fun chasing high scores and Steam achievements. Gauntlet matches are usually pretty quick, lasting anywhere from 5-20 minutes, which makes it easy to jump in for a few runs.\n\nI’ve seen others mention that the game can be very difficult when playing solo, and I can definitely understand why. Once you get into the level 10+ range, the difficulty really starts to ramp up. Since I’ve only played single player, though, I can’t really compare the experience to multiplayer/coop.\n\nOverall, I’ve had a great experience with it and would definitely recommend giving it a try if you enjoy challenging dungeon crawlers and Steam achievement / score chasing.",
